<title>USA: Dallas Semiconductor raises annual dividend.</title>
<headline>Dallas Semiconductor raises annual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dallas Semiconductor Corp on Thursday said its board increased the annual cash dividend on its common stock to $0.14 from $0.12 per share.</p>
<p>The company also said it declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.035 on each outstanding share of its common stock, payable on March 3 to holders on record on February 14.</p>
